WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:04.500
Spare him?! The entire court of civil and military officials is awaiting an execution!

00:04.600 --> 00:11.500
If we spare him, who bears the guilt of this rebellion?! You? Or your elder brother?!

00:11.640 --> 00:16.500
Or do you wish to probe deeper and rip off the facade with the Chen clan completely?!

00:16.500 --> 00:21.000
Do you think that you alone understand this realm, while Zhen is utterly blind?!

00:21.500 --> 00:28.000
Our Sikong house weathered immense turbulence and established our foothold in the south solely by leaning on two grand families:

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
the Zu clan marshaling legions on the frontier, and the Chen clan governing civil administration at court!
